sequenceDiagram
    participant Seq as Sequence
    participant Sqr as Sequencer
    participant Drv as Driver
    participant DUT as DUT
    Seq->>Sqr: start_item / finish_item(req)
    Drv->>Sqr: get_next_item(req)
    Sqr-->>Drv: counter_item handle
    Drv->>DUT: drive reset/enable via interface
    DUT-->>Drv: consumes item at posedge
    Drv->>Sqr: item_done()
    Sqr-->>Seq: transaction completed
